OL,3,GNEWSA'Makes no sense' council chief
OL,4,Atried to distance herself from DUP,
OL,5,Asays lawyer
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe suggestion that a former chief
OL,8,Fexecutive of Mid and East Antrim
OL,9,FCouncil illegally deleted emails to
OL,10,Fdistance herself from the Democratic
OL,11,FUnionist Party (DUP) "makes no sense",
OL,12,Fher barrister has said.
OL,14,FAnne Donaghy's lawyer said she had not
OL,15,Facted because of a perception she was
OL,16,Ftoo close to the DUP but instead out of
OL,17,Fconcern about leaking.
OL,19,FThis, he said, explained why the only
OL,20,Femail deleted was one sent to a
OL,21,Fpersonal email address ` that of
OL,22,Fthen-DUP leader Arlene Foster.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
