OL,3,GNEWSA'Makes no sense' council chief
OL,4,Atried to distance herself from DUP,
OL,5,Asays lawyer
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 56-year-old of Clonmore Road,
OL,8,FDungannon, denies three charges related
OL,9,Fto deleting or attempting to delete an
OL,10,Femail in contravention of the Freedom
OL,11,Fof Information Act and aiding and
OL,12,Fabetting another person to do so.
